{"id":"gradient-mesh","title":"Gradient Mesh — Vivid SaaS","description":"A dark SaaS page wrapped in an animated multi-colour gradient mesh — magenta, violet, cyan and amber blobs bleeding into each other behind gradient-text headlines. The Stripe/Linear energy, colourful edition.","tags":["gradient","mesh","saas"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T19:01:41.455Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Gradient Mesh — Vivid SaaS\ndescription: A dark SaaS page wrapped in an animated multi-colour gradient mesh — magenta, violet, cyan and amber blobs bleeding into each other behind gradient-text headlines. The Stripe/Linear energy, colourful edition.\ntags: [gradient, mesh, saas]\norder: 17\n---\n\n# Gradient Mesh — Vivid SaaS\n\nThe gradient is the design: four huge blurred colour fields drift behind the content while\nthe headline text itself is painted with a moving gradient. Minimal UI on top — the colour\ndoes all the talking.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Base | `#0b0b14` near-black |\n| Mesh | magenta `#ff2ea6` · violet `#7c4dff` · cyan `#00e5ff` · amber `#ffb300`, blurred 100px |\n| Headline | gradient text, animated hue shift |\n| Surfaces | `rgba(255,255,255,0.04)` panels, 1px `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` |\n| Type | system sans, 400-weight display |\n\n## Interaction\n\nBlobs drift on their own and **follow the pointer** with soft parallax; stats count up on\nview; the headline gradient slowly shifts hue.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Gradient Mesh — Vivid SaaS\n\nThe gradient is the design: four huge blurred colour fields drift behind the content while\nthe headline text itself is painted with a moving gradient. Minimal UI on top — the colour\ndoes all the talking.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Base | `#0b0b14` near-black |\n| Mesh | magenta `#ff2ea6` · violet `#7c4dff` · cyan `#00e5ff` · amber `#ffb300`, blurred 100px |\n| Headline | gradient text, animated hue shift |\n| Surfaces | `rgba(255,255,255,0.04)` panels, 1px `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` |\n| Type | system sans, 400-weight display |\n\n## Interaction\n\nBlobs drift on their own and **follow the pointer** with soft parallax; stats count up on\nview; the headline gradient slowly shifts hue.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>PRISM — Gradient Mesh\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0b0b14; color: #f0f0f5; overflow-x: hidden; }\n\n  .mesh { position: fixed; inset: -20%; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; }\n  .blob { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(110px); opacity: 0.5; transition: transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); }\n  .b1 { width: 520px; height: 520px; background: #ff2ea6; top: -10%; left: 8%; }\n  .b2 { width: 460px; height: 460px; background: #7c4dff; top: 30%; right: 2%; }\n  .b3 { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: #00e5ff; bottom: -12%; left: 30%; opacity: 0.4; }\n  .b4 { width: 340px; height: 340px; background: #ffb300; top: 55%; left: -5%; opacity: 0.35; animation: drift 11s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }\n  @keyframes drift { to { transform: translate(90px, -60px) scale(1.2); } }\n\n  .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 26px 0; }\n  .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; }\n  nav .links { display: flex; gap: 22px; font-size: 13.5px; color: #b9b9c8; }\n  nav .links a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n  nav .links a:hover { color: #fff; }\n  nav .btn { color: #0b0b14; background: #fff; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; }\n\n  header { text-align: center; padding: 90px 0 70px; }\n  .kicker { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9d9db0; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 74px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; margin: 18px auto 20px; max-width: 820px;\n    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #ff2ea6, #ffb300, #00e5ff, #7c4dff, #ff2ea6); background-size: 300% 100%; -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; animation: hue 8s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes hue { to { background-position: 300% 0; } }\n  .sub { color: #b9b9c8; font-size: 17px; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 34px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; }\n  .btn-big { background: #fff; color: #0b0b14; border: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px; padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .btn-ghost { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); color: #f0f0f5; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); font: inherit; font-size: 14.5px; padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }\n\n  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; padding: 30px 0 70px; }\n  .stat { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }\n  .stat .n { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  .stat .n.g1 { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff2ea6, #ffb300); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }\n  .stat .n.g2 { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00e5ff, #7c4dff); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }\n  .stat .n.g3 { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffb300, #00e5ff); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }\n  .stat .l { font-size: 12.5px; color: #9d9db0; margin-top: 6px; }\n\n  section.feats { padding-bottom: 80px; }\n  .feats h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3.6vw, 34px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n  .feat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }\n  .feat { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px; }\n  .feat .ic { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .i1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff2ea6, #7c4dff); }\n  .i2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e5ff, #2ea6ff); }\n  .i3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb300, #ff2ea6); }\n  .feat h3 { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .feat p { font-size: 13px; color: #b9b9c8; line-height: 1.7; }\n\n  footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding: 24px 0 40px; text-align: center; color: #9d9db0; font-size: 12.5px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 740px) { .stats, .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } nav .links { display: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"mesh\" id=\"mesh\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"blob b1\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b2\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b3\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b4\">\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"logo\">PRISM\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"links\">\u003ca href=\"#\">Product\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Showcase\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Docs\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">Pricing\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn\">Start free\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"kicker\">Prism 3.0 — the colour engine\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>Colour that moves with your product\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp class=\"sub\">One gradient engine for your whole stack — generate, animate and ship living colour systems without touching a design file.\u003c/p>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ctas\">\n        \u003cbutton class=\"btn-big\">Start creating\u003c/button>\n        \u003cbutton class=\"btn-ghost\" id=\"shuffle\">Shuffle the mesh 🎲\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"stats\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"stat\">\u003cdiv class=\"n g1\" data-n=\"240\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">colour presets\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"stat\">\u003cdiv class=\"n g2\" data-n=\"60\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">fps mesh rendering\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"stat\">\u003cdiv class=\"n g3\" data-n=\"12\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">blend modes\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003csection class=\"feats\">\n      \u003ch2>Built for colour-obsessed teams\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"feat-grid\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"feat\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic i1\">🎨\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Living palettes\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Palettes that react to time, data and mood. Export to CSS, Tailwind or Swift in one click.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"feat\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic i2\">🌈\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Mesh generation\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Type a sentence, get a gradient mesh. Our engine reads emotion words and paints accordingly.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"feat\">\u003cdiv class=\"ic i3\">✨\u003c/div>\u003ch3>Contrast guard\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Every combination is checked against WCAG so your colour stays loud and your text stays readable.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/section>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>© 2026 Prism — colour is a feature, not decoration\u003c/footer>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // pointer parallax on the mesh blobs\n    const blobs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.blob'));\n    addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      const cx = innerWidth / 2, cy = innerHeight / 2;\n      const dx = (e.clientX - cx) / cx, dy = (e.clientY - cy) / cy;\n      blobs.forEach((b, i) => {\n        const f = (i + 1) * 14;\n        b.style.transform = `translate(${dx * f}px, ${dy * f}px)`;\n      });\n    });\n    // shuffle button randomises blob colours\n    const pool = ['#ff2ea6', '#7c4dff', '#00e5ff', '#ffb300', '#69f0ae', '#ff5252', '#40c4ff'];\n    document.getElementById('shuffle').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const shuffled = pool.slice().sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);\n      blobs.forEach((b, i) => b.style.background = shuffled[i % shuffled.length]);\n    });\n    // count-up stats\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => es.forEach(en => {\n      if (!en.isIntersecting || en.target.dataset.done) return;\n      en.target.dataset.done = 1;\n      const target = +en.target.dataset.n, t0 = performance.now();\n      (function tick(t) {\n        const p = Math.min((t - t0) / 1300, 1);\n        en.target.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3)));\n        if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n      })(t0);\n    }), { threshold: 0.6 });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-n]').forEach(el => io.observe(el));\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value: